   "value": "The study used the Semantic Object Retrieval Test during fMRI to characterize semantic memory retrieval and its neural correlates in Gulf War veterans classified with Syndromes 1, 2, or 3 and matched deployed controls.",
   "value_source": "reported",
   "evidence": {
    "status": "present",
